1
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:49,200
Nephew, you're here.

2
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,840
And Mei girl came along too.

3
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,359
Uncle Qi.

4
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:53,520
Come, have a seat.

5
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,479
Why did you call me here?

6
00:00:55,439 --> 00:00:56,359
Nephew.

7
00:00:58,119 --> 00:01:00,159
Your situation in the Sheng Family,

8
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,359
I've heard a little about it.

9
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,560
Must be tough.

10
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:06,799
For an outsider to gain a foothold there,

11
00:01:06,799 --> 00:01:09,239
is nearly impossible.

12
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,480
Bullshit.

13
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:14,040
What do you mean?

14
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,079
Keep spouting bullshit.

15
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,879
You...

16
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:22,480
I just mean well.

17
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,000
I can give you a chance.

18
00:01:24,599 --> 00:01:27,159
Thirty li west of here,

19
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:31,239
Black Wind Ridge's Sleeping Moon Valley.

20
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:32,799
It holds an ancient sacrificial pit.

21
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,319
The pit isn't big,

22
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:37,400
but I hear it holds lots of good stuff.

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,319
Our Qi Family

24
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:42,239
has never had the time to deal with it.

25
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:44,599
If you're willing,

26
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:46,719
I can provide you with a map.

27
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:49,439
And I can tell you the entrance.

28
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:54,879
As long as you can bring something out,

29
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:59,400
I might share what happened 20 years ago.

30
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,040
I know.

31
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,799
I know about it.

32
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,560
Isn't Old Master Qi talking about

33
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,359
where those who return lose their voices,

34
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,079
the Mute Pit?

35
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:06,760
Rumors.

36
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,439
Those are pure rumors.

37
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,000
It's just hearsay.

38
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,280
It might be a little bit dangerous,

39
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,479
but wealth is found in danger.

40
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:16,360
Right?

41
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:19,240
If you bring out one or two Grave goods,

42
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,719
Not only in the Sheng Family

43
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:22,280
will you gain prestige,

44
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,719
but in our Qi Family,

45
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:25,240
we will also owe you a favor.

46
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,080
It's killing two birds with one stone.

47
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,039
Besides, as far as I know,

48
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:35,159
The dragon-seeking Zhang family,

49
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,400
someone from their lineage

50
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:40,120
might have been there too.

51
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:48,199
Does this old geezer want me buried there?

52
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,319
If you go,

53
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:52,840
I'll make sure you're buried there,

54
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,879
and never come out.

55
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:57,560
Give me the map.

56
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:58,800
Alright.

57
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,759
How decisive.

58
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,439
Uncle Qi.

59
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,479
By the order of the family head,

60
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,960
I must protect Zhang Tianyou's safety.

61
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:07,319
I will go with him.

62
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,759
That's wonderful.

63
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,360
With Miss Mei as his escort,

64
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,719
I couldn't ask for more!

65
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,599
Young Master.

66
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,560
I think this place is a bit...

67
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,479
a bit eerie.

68
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,759
I've explored tombs for half my life,

69
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,639
and I've never seen a place this clean.

70
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,439
There's not a single ant on the ground.

71
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,560
The air has a sweet, bloody scent.

72
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,319
Like rotting flowers mixed with rust.

73
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:54,319
It's not rust.

74
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,439
The soil is black

75
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,280
and has a bloody stench.

76
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,560
It's Corpse-blood soil.

77
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:05,120
More than one or two people died here.

78
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:09,159
Qi Lianhai wants me to die here.

79
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:12,560
Or maybe this is just...

80
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:13,919
a test.

81
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:14,800
What test?

82
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,160
To test who I am.

83
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:19,360
To see if I can handle the Tidal Tomb.

84
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,160
Let's go. Hurry up!

85
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:30,680
Wait.

86
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,879
It's fine.

87
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:38,759
Let's go.

88
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,720
Who's chasing me?

89
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,040
Who's chasing me?!

90
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,560
Someone is chasing me!

91
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,680
There's no one.

92
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,439
No, didn't you hear that?

93
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,240
Look.

94
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,319
It's an echo.

95
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,600
An echo?

96
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:08,079
There's constant geological pressure,

97
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,639
causing underground water vibrations.

98
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,160
Focus!

99
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:34,079
I... I'm wide awake.

100
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,000
Alright, alright.

101
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,439
Give me one! Give me one!

102
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,800
How is it?

103
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,399
I'm good, I'm good.

104
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,800
This thing of yours works great!

105
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,079
Better than a black donkey hoof.

106
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,199
Looks like you came well-prepared.

107
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:57,839
I said, you came well-prepared.

108
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,800
Alright, alright. Let's go.

109
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:29,000
What is this place?

110
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,319
Young Master.

111
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,959
Are these the people who came before us?

112
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:06,680
This looks like a sacrificial pit.

113
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,720
It's not a sacrificial pit.

114
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,680
This is a stomach.

115
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,800
A stomach that can swallow people alive.

116
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,800
I can't cut it!

117
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,199
Zhang Tianyou!

118
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,480
Think of something!

119
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,279
What do we do?

120
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,279
Why isn't it attacking you?

121
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:51,240
It's the Zhang family's evil-warding lock.

122
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:25,800
Got it.

123
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,600
Chant with me.

124
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,120
Chant what?

125
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:56,879
Come on.

126
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,159
Zhang Tianyou.

127
00:09:30,399 --> 00:09:31,080
Let's go.

128
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:43,679
Dead end.

129
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:57,320
What is this thing?

130
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,519
Is this...

131
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:01,159
...an illusion?

132
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,200
It's not an illusion. It's a memory.

133
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:06,159
He seems to be retracing his final steps.

134
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:07,120
Let's go. Follow him.

135
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:07,919
Let's go.

136
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:16,919
Come on.

137
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,120
Brother Shu!

138
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,120
Brother Shu!

139
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,080
Watch out!

140
00:10:30,399 --> 00:10:31,679
That bastard Qi Lianhai...

141
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,559
He obviously sent us here to die!

142
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,799
Do you recognize this thing?

143
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:47,919
Father.

144
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:50,480
Were you here twenty years ago too?

145
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,840
Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

146
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:55,360
I'm so close to gathering everything.
